    {
      "title": "新建字典类型",
      "width": 1440,
      "items": [
        {
          "label": "类型键",
          "hint": "供字段引用的唯一标识，如 resort_facility；小写字母开头，创建后不可修改。",
          "fontSize": "13px",
          "color": "rgb(73, 94, 128)",
          "fits": true,
          "describedBy": "dictType_extra",
          "extraId": "dictType_extra"
        },
        {
          "label": "类型名称",
          "hint": "后台显示的字典名称，如“雪场设施”，最多100字。",
          "fontSize": "13px",
          "color": "rgb(73, 94, 128)",
          "fits": true,
          "describedBy": "dictName_extra",
          "extraId": "dictName_extra"
        },
        {
          "label": "分组键",
          "hint": "用于归类字典，如 resort；小写字母开头，可含数字及 . _ : -。",
          "fontSize": "13px",
          "color": "rgb(73, 94, 128)",
          "fits": true,
          "describedBy": "groupKey_extra",
          "extraId": "groupKey_extra"
        },
        {
          "label": "允许公开 RAG 检索",
          "hint": "开启后，启用的字典项可用于 AI 公开检索；需要等待索引完成。",
          "fontSize": "13px",
          "color": "rgb(73, 94, 128)",
          "fits": true,
          "describedBy": "publiclyReadable_extra",
          "extraId": "publiclyReadable_extra"
